s","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-31","description":"The AML policy must adhere to Curacao AML laws. Please submit.","notes":null},{"title":"Company Details and Dynamic Seal","tag":"Operations","criticality":"High","due":"2025-03-31","description":"The applicant's company details must be made available in the homepage footer of all registered domains together with the CGA's dynamic seal. Please follow the instructions on the following page for the proper display of the dynamic seal: https://portal.gamingcontrolcuracao.org/","notes":null}]},{"name":"Responsible Gaming","criticality":"Critical","items":[{"title":"ID verification procedure","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-30","description":"ID verification procedure","notes":null},{"title":"Account closure procedure","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-30","description":"Account closure procedure upon the operator becoming aware that the player is a minor post-registration.","notes":null},{"title":"Record-keeping","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-08","description":"Record-keeping","notes":null},{"title":"Contacting the operator","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-08","description":"Procedure on how the player can contact the operator regarding RG concerns via email or chat","notes":null},{"title":"Language","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-30","description":"Must be available in English and target market language","notes":null},{"title":"Vulnerable gamblers","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-30","description":"RG policy should include a structured process on flagging potential vulnerable gamblers","notes":null},{"title":"Indicators of problem gambling","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-30","description":"Must have a structured process for responding to indicators of problem gambling","notes":null},{"title":"Player profiling and Risk Assessment","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-30","description":"Establish player profiles to assess risk levels","notes":null},{"title":"Monitoring and intervention","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-30","description":"Adopt RBA to determine level of monitoring and intervention","notes":null},{"title":"Recording RG interactions","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-30","description":"Record all RG interactions in PAM system","notes":null},{"title":"Identification of vulnerable persons","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-30","description":"Procedure to follow for players identified as vulnerable persons","notes":null},{"title":"Cooling-off period","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-30","description":"Operator must offer players option to activate a cooling-off period","notes":null},{"title":"Cooling-off options","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-30","description":"Options for cooling-off must include duration and marketing opt-out at minimum","notes":null},{"title":"Self-Exclusion","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-30","description":"Operator must offer players the option to self-exclude themselves for a duration of at least 1 year","notes":null},{"title":"Deposit Limits","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-30","description":"Players must be able to set limits on the total amount they deposit","notes":null},{"title":"Training and Staff Readiness","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-30","description":"Operators must train customer service and Responsible Gaming staff to handle player interaction profesionally and effectively","notes":null},{"title":"Consumer Advertising and Marketing","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-08","description":"Operators must not engage in irresponsible advertising","notes":null},{"title":"Internet Filtering Tools","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Low","due":"2026-04-30","description":"The operator is advised to remind adults that they should take precautions when sharing devices with minors","notes":null},{"title":"Notifications for concerning behaviours","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"High","due":"2026-05-08","description":"Operators may employ automatic or manual pop-up notifications in response to concerning behaviours","notes":null},{"title":"Initiating direct contact","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-04-30","description":"When a player exhibits behaviour that reasonably suggests they may be a Vulnerable Player, the operator must initiate direct contact","notes":null},{"title":"Other Limits","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"High","due":"2026-04-30","description":"Other limits may be considered including loss limits, time limits or wager limits, in line wth the operator's target player and/or market","notes":null}]},{"name":"Player Complaints","criticality":"Critical","items":[{"title":"Recommencing ADR process with a different entity","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-08","description":"The policy must state that once the ADR process is completed it cannot be recommenced by either the player or the operator with another different ADR entity.","notes":null}]}]}]}